    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Owen Reilly presents this impressive two-bedroom plus study penthouse offering exceptionally bright, spacious accommodation in the highly regarded Adelaide Square development in the heart of central Dublin. Occupying a prime top-floor position, the apartment benefits from a B energy rating, excellent ceiling heights, extensive glazing, a private balcony and access to a superb communal roof terrace shared by just two penthouse apartments. One designated parking space is included, with additional parking available at an extra cost.\r\n\r\nThe generous open-plan living and dining room is a particular highlight, with high ceilings, timber flooring and extensive glazing creating a wonderful sense of light and space. Direct access to the private balcony further enhances the living accommodation and provides valuable outdoor space in this central city setting.\r\n\r\nThe well-appointed kitchen features excellent storage, integrated appliances and a breakfast bar, while the accommodation also includes a welcoming entrance hall, two generous double bedrooms, two bathrooms and a separate study/utility room. The principal bedroom is particularly spacious with extensive fitted wardrobes and an en-suite bathroom. The second bedroom is also a comfortable double, while the separate study provides highly desirable additional space, ideal for working from home.\r\n\r\nA standout feature of the penthouse is the expansive rooftop terrace, which is communal but accessible only to the two penthouse apartments, providing a rare sense of space and exclusivity in such a central location.\r\n\r\nPresented in excellent condition and available fully furnished, this is an exceptional city home offering considerably more space and flexibility than a typical two-bedroom apartment.\r\n\r\nAdelaide Square is a prestigious, secure gated development with a 24-hour security desk and concierge service. Its location is exceptionally convenient, with St. Stephen's Green, Grafton Street, Camden Street, Dublin Castle and the wider city centre all within easy walking distance. An outstanding selection of cafés, restaurants, shops, gyms and entertainment is on the doorstep, while numerous Dublin Bus routes and the Luas Green Line provide excellent connectivity throughout the city.\r\n\r\nA superb penthouse offering exceptional space, natural light, two excellent outdoor areas, parking and a separate study in one of Dublin city centre's most convenient residential developments. Viewing is highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Available immediately.\r\nBright and spacious interior.\r\nB energy rating.\r\nTwo spacious double bedrooms plus study.\r\nLocated in the secure Adelaide Square development.\r\nSecure and designated parking space.\r\n24-hour security desk and concierge.\r\nSpacious open-plan living/dining room.\r\nFloor to ceiling glazing and excellent natural light.\r\nPrivate balcony off the living area.\r\nShared private roof terrace.\r\nFully fitted kitchen with breakfast bar & utility room.\r\nAmple storage.\r\nFully furnished.\r\nAdditional parking available at an extra cost.\r\nPrime city centre location close to St. Stephen’s Green and Grafton Street."
      },
      {
